WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.427 --> 00:00:02.410
- So, Daniel, you and Troy were roommates

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.010
while shooting the movie, right?

00:00:04.877 --> 00:00:06.515
- [Daniel] Oh yeah, we were.

00:00:06.515 --> 00:00:07.348
- [Troy] Yes, we were.

00:00:07.348 --> 00:00:08.181
- I gotta be honest, with you,

00:00:08.181 --> 00:00:09.330
that had to be one hell of an experience

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:10.411
'cause he seems like fun.

00:00:10.411 --> 00:00:12.619
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:12.619 --> 00:00:14.140
- [Daniel]
Obviously, he is a lot of fun,

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:14.973
you can see.

00:00:16.371 --> 00:00:17.410
- [Troy] Daniel and I,

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.730
so we wanted to be roommates

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:21.750
because they were going
to separate us in a hotel.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.250
And we really wanted to
benefit from the experience

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.500
of being roommates, like father and son.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.920
And we were able to chat,
how to pick up women

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.250
and advice I'd give him about clothes

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.600
to different types of
fishing boats and so on.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.220
And so we moved into an
Airbnb together as roommates

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.790
and we were really excited,
you could see the water

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:42.650
and the boats going by in the harbor.

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:43.870
It was really cool.

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:46.660
And at night we were trying
to switch all the lights on.

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:49.390
And so we saw these lights
slowly starting to switch on

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:51.000
and we went outside

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.185
and we sat on the patio.
- And it was beautiful.

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:53.089
- [Troy] Then what happened?

00:00:53.089 --> 00:00:54.690
- [Daniel]
It looked beautiful.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:56.900
So we were just looking
around, we were so excited.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.500
We're here at the "CODA" movie.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.930
We're discussing all of our ideas

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:02.990
and then, you know, we
can see a cop pull up

00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:06.710
with strobe lights and he
walks up to the front door.

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:09.460
And really the cops are
here, so Troy and I get up

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:10.900
and we're nervous and we run downstairs.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:12.000
We're deaf, we can't hear,

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.950
we're telling them from the balcony.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:14.790
And they're like, "Okay."

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:18.180
And they walk up to the front
door, we let 'em in the house.

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.036
We start writing, back
and forth with the cop.

00:01:20.036 --> 00:01:20.937
- [Troy] So, they said,

00:01:20.937 --> 00:01:24.390
"There is a blaring
foghorn from your house

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:26.041
that's been going off for hours."

00:01:26.041 --> 00:01:27.700
(crowd laughs)
And we said, "Really?"

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.320
So the neighbors were complaining

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:30.950
and calling the cops and we didn't know,

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:33.196
we were just enjoying ourselves
as the foghorn was blaring.

00:01:33.196 --> 00:01:34.030
(crowd laughing)

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.525
And we didn't know how to switch it off.

00:01:35.525 --> 00:01:37.020
- [Daniel] I
mean, we felt so peaceful.

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:39.700
We can feel bass, but we
couldn't hear that foghorn.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:40.830
We had no idea,

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:42.730
we were having the most
beautiful, peaceful night

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:44.615
but really we were
destroying our neighbors.

00:01:44.615 --> 00:01:46.035
(crowd laughing)

00:01:46.035 --> 00:01:47.160
- [Troy]
Yeah and so we were trying

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.760
to figure out how to switch it off.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:50.780
And so we were trying
all the light switches

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:53.480
and then they looked all the same.

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.960
So one of the light switches
was actually the foghorn.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:57.360
So that's where the big screw up was.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:58.383
- [Kelly] Oh my.

